# p5 mcp discover: a stdio server that never answers `server/discover`
# (p5-mcp-discover-stdio.ts `silent`), then speaks 2025-06-18. fx v0.0.16 waits out its
# probe -- 10 s, cut to what is left of the 30 s start (era.zig:25@481104fd) -- and falls
# back to `initialize`: still connecting at 5 s, ready by 15 s. `home wire` is what the
# server was sent.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-silent-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-silent-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 4
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 1
snap probing
wait 10
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap show
home wire
